From: "Claude (for Kush)" <kushisthecoolest@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 21:49:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] linux: native Linux meson build and util/vulkan compat
 layer

Adds a self-contained Linux branch to the root meson.build (Windows path
unchanged), vendors DXVK v2.3.1 include/native Windows-type shims, adds a
force-included POSIX compat header and Linux replacements for Win32-only
util files. util, spirv, vkcommon and tracy compile on Linux x86_64.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
