+// Force-included into every C++ translation unit of the native Linux build.
+// Provides the subset of the Win32 API the runtime uses, implemented over POSIX.
+// The runtime is headless on Linux, so window and monitor queries return neutral defaults.
+// See documentation/LinuxBuild.md for the design.
